            { "TOOTH", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Gnawing Maw</style>
Recovered still chewing. When anything dies near it, it closes around the remains and a thin, cold film spreads over the holder's skin." },
            { "HOOF", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Hoof</style>
