            { "WARBANNER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Dread Standard</style>
Raised once, near a waking gate. Everyone beneath it felt a terrible confidence that was not their own. No one beneath it remembers raising it." },
            { "SLUG", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Shelled Polyp</style>
It pulses in the dark, slow as breathing. Wounds near it close. Whatever it is feeding on, it is not us." },
            { "PSG", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Carapace</style>
A shell grown in the deep, molded around something that was never found. It hardens around anyone who wears it. It does not let go easily." },
            { "MEDKIT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Mending Spore</style>
A white kit, overgrown. When the holder is struck, spores burst from the seams and settle into the wound. The wound closes. The spores remain." },
            { "GASOLINE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Ichor Flask</style>
Not fuel. Something thicker. It bursts out of the dead in a cold, dark wave that burns without light." },
            { "STUNGRENADE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Stillness Pearl</style>
A pearl that does not reflect. Strikes carry a little of its stillness, and the struck find their limbs held by something unseen." },
            { "FIREWORK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Starless Rockets</style>
""They go up,"" the witness said, ""but there's no light. Just a hole where the sky should be, and then they come down on whatever's nearest.""" },
            { "ENERGYDRINK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Nectar</style>
Tastes of nothing. The drinker reports feeling lighter, quicker, and faintly hungry for something they cannot name." },
            { "BACKUPMAG", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Echoing Clip</style>
Every round fired from this magazine returns to it, a fraction of a second later, slightly colder than before." },
            { "STICKYBOMB", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Clinging Spawn</style>
They cling, as the old bombs did. They also hatch. Please keep the holding tank sealed at all times." },
            { "APR", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Piercing Hollow</style>
The round is hollow, and so is what it leaves behind. Critical strikes from it seem to reach a little further inside than they should." },
            { "TOPAZ", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Onyx Brooch</style>
The stone is black where it was once gold. It still gathers what the dying leave behind, but it gives it back as something colder." },
            { "FOCUS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Gravity Lens</style>
The crystal bends space toward the holder. Nearby things fall a little toward them. Some never stop falling." },
            { "STEAK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Marrow Cut</style>
A cut of something that was never alive. Eating it makes the body heavier, sturdier, harder to empty." },
            { "ARMORPLATE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Fractal Plating</style>
Each plate is made of smaller plates, and those of smaller plates, all the way down. Blows simply get lost in it." },
            { "MOCHA", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Nightshade Brew</style>
Black, bitter, and still steaming after a week in cold storage. One sip, and the drinker does not sleep for three days. They do not seem to need to." },
            { "ELIXIR", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Tidal Draught</style>
It ebbs and flows in the bottle like a tide with no moon. Drunk at the edge of death, it pulls the drinker back." },
            { "WATCH", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Cracked Hourglass</style>
The sand falls upward. When the glass breaks, and it always breaks, the holder has more time than they ought to." },
            { "OPAL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Lightless Opal</style>
It shimmers with colors that have no names. The holder becomes hard to hurt, as if most of them were somewhere else." },
            { "PENNIES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Tarnished Coins</style>
Pain drops them from the air around the holder. They are cold, and heavy, and the vendors accept them without question." },
            { "ANTLERS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Antlers of Silence</style>
Shed from a creature that walked between worlds. The holder's footsteps make no sound, and their stride never seems to end." },
            { "LANTERN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Smothered Lantern</style>
The flame burns black. It brightens when crowds gather near it, friend or foe, and it makes the hand that carries it faster." },
            { "CHRONIC", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Collapsing Star</style>
A tiny dying sun in a bottle. Every kill feeds it, and every feeding makes it pull a little harder on the next." },
            { "ECHO", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Resounding Shell</style>
Strike it and the sound comes back much later, quieter, and from inside the holder's chest." },
            { "ECLIPSELITE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Umbral Disc</style>
A disc of shadow that orbits nothing. When the holder's skills rest, it wraps them in a thin, dark barrier." },
            { "HIKER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Descent Treads</style>
Boots worn by someone who kept walking down, and down, and down. Each step lower makes their aim truer." },
            { "FEATHER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Ink-Stained Quill</style>
Writes in the air. Whatever it writes, the holder can step on. It is unclear who taught it to write." },
            { "SEED", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Parasite Bloom</style>
It flowers on wounds, and drinks, and passes some of what it drinks back to the one who carries it." },
            { "PREDATORY", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Ravenous Eye</style>
It never blinks. It watches for weak points, and when it finds one, the holder's hands quicken." },
            { "WHIP", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Lash of Night</style>
It cracks without sound. Out of combat, the holder moves as fast as the shadows do." },
            { "STEALTHKIT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Veil Wrap</style>
A cloth that hides the wearer from light, and from sight, and occasionally from their own reflection." },
            { "SCYTHE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Reaper's Hook</style>
A blade that remembers every precise strike. Each one returns a sliver of life to the hand that swung it." },
            { "INFUSION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hungering Vessel</style>
It fills with what the holder kills. It never fills completely. It never stops trying." },
            { "BANDOLIER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Spent Casings</style>
Empty shells, all of them. When they fall to the ground they ring like bells, and the holder's skills come back sooner." },
            { "PAULDRON", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Howling Mantle</style>
Silent most days. After a slaughter it howls, and everyone nearby feels something deep in their chest answer." },
            { "BUCKLER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abyssal Aegis</style>
A shield with no back. Blows that strike its face land somewhere else entirely." },
            { "RUNALD", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Frozen Abyss Band</style>
Colder than ice. When it strikes, the target freezes into something that is not quite frost." },
            { "QUAIL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Wing</style>
A wing with no bird. It flaps when the holder jumps, and carries them further than any wing should." },
            { "GUILLOTINE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Cleaver</style>
The blade does not cut flesh. It cuts the will to keep living, and it prefers the strong." },
            { "WARHORN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Silent Horn</style>
Blown, it makes no sound. But every equipment the holder uses afterward hums with borrowed power." },
            { "DAISY", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Wilting Daisy</style>
It droops, but it never dies. When the gates open, it releases a cold breath that mends the living." },
            { "RAZORWIRE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Barbed Coil</style>
It coils tighter when its holder is hurt, and lashes out at whoever caused the hurt." },
            { "GHOR", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hoarder's Codex</style>
Every page is a ledger of things that were lost. Kills write new entries. The entries pay out." },
            { "SQUID", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Drowned Polyp</style>
Pulled from a sea that is not on any map. Planted, it grows a turret that watches and strikes with drowned patience." },
            { "DEATHMARK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Brand of Ruin</style>
It burns its mark onto the weakened. Marked creatures come apart much more easily than they should." },
            { "HARPOON", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Undertow Hook</style>
Each kill drags the holder forward, as though something under the surface has them by the ankle." },
            { "IGNITION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Smothering Tank</style>
Its fuel burns cold and dark. The things it burns don't scream. They just go quiet." },
            { "SHURIKEN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Star</style>
Thrown, it vanishes. A moment later it arrives, already buried in its target." },
            { "REGENSCRAP", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Reforming Husk</style>
It breaks and reforms, breaks and reforms. Each time it comes back, it's a little more wrong." },
            { "SHIPPING", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Unmarked Parcel</style>
No sender. No address. No one remembers signing for it. It arrives anyway, every time." },
            { "FIN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Undertow Fin</style>
Blows struck by its holder pull rather than push. Enemies find themselves dragged toward something deep and hungry." },
            { "DOLL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Effigy</style>
Its face has been rubbed smooth. Shrines offer more to whoever carries it. The doll offers nothing at all." },
            { "LUMINOUS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Dim Shot</style>
Fires darkness. The first shots of every volley strike harder, as though the dark itself had weight." },
            { "NOXIOUS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Spreading Blight</style>
One sick creature becomes two. Two become many. The blight remembers the way." },
            { "BEADS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Rosary of Silence</style>
Counted in the dark, they make no sound. Each bead counted makes the counter a little stronger." },
            { "SALESTAR", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Black Star</style>
It marks things as cheaper. It does not say what the real price is." },
            { "TRANSMITTER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Rift Beacon</style>
When the holder is near death, the beacon calls, and something folds them out of harm's reach." },
            { "DYNAMITEBOX", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Pressure Charge</style>
Packed so tight it groans. Allies near it leave charges behind them like breadcrumbs." },
            { "COMPULSION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Collector's Void</style>
It wants everything broken. Every piece of scrap the holder carries makes it a little more content." },
            { "FARADAY", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Static Hollow</style>
The air hums inside the hollow. When the holder leaps, the hum leaps out and strikes the nearest thing." },
            { "DAMPENER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Kinetic Sink</style>
It drinks motion. Shields charged near it soak up more than they should." },
            { "BEHEMOTH", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Imploding Core</style>
It does not explode. It collapses, pulling everything nearby inward before letting go." },
            { "CEREMONIAL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Fang</style>
A dagger made of an absence. When its holder kills, smaller absences scatter out and find new prey." },
            { "FROSTRELIC", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abyssal Maelstrom</style>
A storm of black ice that grows with every kill. The researchers have stopped going near it." },
            { "HAPPIESTMASK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Lament Mask</style>
It weeps. Those it weeps for sometimes rise again, briefly, to fight beside the one who wears it." },
            { "HEADSTOMPERS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Gravity Well</style>
The wearer falls faster, harder, and further than they ought to. So does everything beneath them." },
            { "NKUHANA", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Devouring Opinion</style>
It has decided. It has always decided. Healing feeds it, and it spits that healing out as harm." },
            { "TESLA", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Coil</style>
Coils of something darker than copper. It crackles with a current that has no source." },
            { "MEATHOOK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Grasping Hook</style>
Each hook is a hand. They reach for anything nearby, and they don't let go." },
            { "ALIENHEAD", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Starless Mind</style>
It thinks faster than anything alive. Near it, so does everyone else." },
            { "SOULBOUND", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Catalyst</style>
It swallows the last breath of the dying and returns it as time." },
            { "AFTERBURNER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Thrusters</style>
Their exhaust is black and silent. Their holder moves as though gravity were only a suggestion." },
            { "VULTURES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Carrion Crown</style>
It wears the essence of the elite dead. Each one it takes, it shares a sliver of with its bearer." },
            { "BRAINSTALKS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Thoughts</style>
The stalks whisper. After an elite falls, the whispers quiet, and the holder's skills seem to refresh on their own." },
            { "RACK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Empty Rack</style>
Nothing hangs on it. Yet when its holder heals, the healing seems to come from a much larger rack, somewhere else." },
            { "AEGIS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Shattered Aegis</style>
Broken into a thousand pieces, each still holding its shape. Surplus life gathers in the cracks." },
            { "JUSTICE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Unmaking Gavel</style>
Its verdict is not death. It is undoing. Struck foes find their armor no longer remembers how to protect them." },
            { "RESONANCE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Silent Disc</style>
It spins without sound. When its silence finally breaks, everything nearby breaks with it." },
            { "DESKPLANT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Withered Planter</style>
The plant is long dead. The roots underneath are not." },
            { "MICROBOTS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Field</style>
A swarm of points of nothing. Projectiles that pass through them simply cease." },
            { "LASERSCOPE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Sight</style>
Looking through the scope, the user sees exactly where things are weakest. They also see things that are not there. Or should not be." },
            { "ICBM", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abyssal Payload</style>
Missiles fired through it multiply in transit. Nobody has ever seen them leave the tube." },
            { "DRONEPARTS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Cannibal Circuitry</style>
It strips parts from things that aren't there and bolts them onto drones that are." },
            { "SCORPION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Stinger</style>
It stings, and stings, and stings. The venom doesn't wear off. It just keeps settling deeper." },
            { "RAINCOAT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Shroud of Stillness</style>
Nothing sticks to it: not water, not poison, not fire, not fear." },
            { "BOTTLEDCHAOS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Unbottled Void</style>
The bottle broke long ago. What it held is still in the room." },
            { "BOOMERANG", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Returning Eclipse</style>
It flies out, it comes back, and the light around it dims a little each time." },
            { "NECTAR", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Rotting Nectar</style>
Sweet and foul at once. Everything that drinks it grows stronger. Everything that drinks it also grows wrong." },
            { "RUNICLENS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Fallen Rune</style>
Its runes no longer read as words. When they glow, things fall from a sky that is not this one." },
            { "SONOROUS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Muted Whispers</style>
The dead used to speak to it. Now they don't. Things still fall from their hands." },
            { "WARBONDS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Debt</style>
A bond that cannot be repaid. Each time it comes due, something is fired from very far away." },
            { "NETWORKED", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Severed Network</style>
The links are cut, but the pain still travels. It just takes a stranger route now." },
            { "ORPHANED", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abandoned Nucleus</style>
It was the heart of something vast. Now it beats alone, and it is lonely." },
            { "DUPLICATOR", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Copy</style>
Copies of things that were never made. They work. Nobody knows why." },
            { "ARCANEBLADES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Eclipsed Blades</style>
The blades spin faster when the gates are open. Their edges cut light." },
            { "BITTERROOT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Root</style>
A root with no plant. Chewing it fills the chewer with a strength that tastes of ash." },
            { "FIRESHIELD", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Shield</style>
When struck hard, it vents a pulse of nothing. Anything caught in the nothing is hurt." },
            { "LIFESAVINGS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Sunken Savings</style>
Gold from the bottom of a black sea. It keeps paying out, but every coin is cold." },
            { "MUCONSTRUCT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Construct</style>
A tiny machine, built from the absence of a machine. It follows its owner and mends what it can." },
            { "MYSTERIOUSVIAL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Murky Vial</style>
You cannot see the bottom of the vial. The liquid inside is warm. Drink, and the body knits." },
            { "PENNY", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Penny</style>
A coin with no face, no tail, and no value. Pain shakes them loose anyway." },
            { "SNAKEEYES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Blind Dice</style>
They have no pips. Every roll lands on the same face. The same face is always bad luck for someone else." },
            { "TOXIN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Seeping Toxin</style>
It doesn't spread through the air. It spreads through the presence of the one carrying it." },
            { "MEATNUGGET", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Rotten Morsel</style>
Gray, cold, and pulsing. Kills scatter it in little pieces. They heal whoever is foolish enough to eat them." },
            { "TASER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Prod</style>
It discharges something that isn't electricity. The target stops moving, and seems to stop thinking." },
            { "SPIKESTRIP", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Grasping Caltrops</style>
The points open like fingers. Whatever steps on them is held." },
            { "HERMITSCARF", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Shadow Scarf</style>
Its wearer is never quite where the blow lands. They are always somewhere a little to the left of where you thought." },
            { "BARBEDWIRE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Thorned Void</style>
A ring of barbs that cut only what is not its holder. The wounds don't bleed. They empty." },
            { "VOLTAICMITT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Static Glove</style>
The glove hums when lifted off the ground. The hum is not electric. It is closer to a voice." },
            { "ARMSRACE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Arms of the Deep</style>
Mechanical things near it sprout new weapons. The weapons are always pointed at something." },
            { "TOUGHTIMES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hard Shell</style>
A toy bear, gone gray and stiff. Blows aimed at its holder simply don't arrive." },
            { "BOXINGGLOVES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Crushing Grip</style>
The gloves don't push. They squeeze, and whatever they squeeze stays squeezed." },
            { "CLOVER56", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Wilted Clover</style>
Every leaf is gray. Luck still clings to it, but the luck has teeth." },
            { "ENERGYCELL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Drained Cell</style>
Nearly empty, always. The emptier its holder becomes, the harder it hums." },
            { "GOLDENGUN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Tarnished Gun</style>
Its shine is gone. It still grows stronger the richer its holder is, but the gold it counts is not quite real." },
            { "GUARDIANSHEART", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Heart</style>
It no longer beats. It just waits, and when its holder needs it, it fills with something cold and protective." },
            { "LOCKEDJEWEL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Clouded Jewel</style>
The jewel is cloudy with something moving inside. Opening chests lets a little of it out." },
            { "MORTARTUBE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Mortar</style>
Its shells arc up and never come down. Somewhere else, something is struck." },
            { "PRISONSHACKLES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abyssal Chains</style>
Chains that bind not the body, but the speed of it." },
            { "ROYALMEDALLION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Fallen Medallion</style>
The crown it bore has crumbled away. Its authority has not." },
            { "RUSTYJETPACK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Sunken Jetpack</style>
Pulled from a black lake. It still works. The water it vents is not water." },
            { "SMARTSHOPPER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hoarder's Purse</style>
The purse always returns a little more than was spent. The extra is cold to the touch." },
            { "TIMEKEEPER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Stopped Clock</style>
Its hands haven't moved in centuries. When its holder nears death, nothing else moves either." },
            { "CHARGEFIELD", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Null Field Generator</style>
Kills charge it with silence. The silence spreads outward and stills anything it touches." },
            { "CONCUSSION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Silencing Grenade</style>
It goes off without sound. The struck don't fall. They simply forget how to move." },
            { "DEADMANSFOOT", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Drowned Foot</style>
Found in a riverbed, still wearing a sock. When its holder is badly hurt, the river comes back to claim something." },
            { "PANICMINES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Mines</style>
They hide in the ground, waiting for the holder to be afraid. They are always waiting." },
            { "PROPHETSCAPE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Heretic's Cape</style>
It was cut from a prophet's cloak and turned inside out. Blows struck against it feed it." },
            { "INSECTICIDE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Black Spray</style>
It kills more than insects. It keeps killing, long after it's been sprayed." },
            { "DECAYINGSAMPLE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Rotting Sample</style>
It orbits, as the old sample did. But slower, and colder, and its touch takes something away." },
            { "FILIAL", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abandoned Brood</style>
The eggs never hatched. Something else did." },
            { "CENTIPEDE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Crawler</style>
It has more legs than it should and fewer than it wants. It moves from host to host, always forward." },
            { "HITLIST", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Death Ledger</style>
Names appear in it before their owners die. Every name crossed out rewards the one who crossed it." },
            { "HYPERTHREADER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Unravelling Thread</style>
It pulls at the seams of the world. Whatever it pulls at comes apart." },
            { "PERMAFROST", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abyssal Frost</style>
Cold from the bottom of everything. Things it touches don't freeze; they stop." },
            { "THALLIUM", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Thallium</style>
A poison so slow it hardly seems to act. By the time it does, there is nothing left to save." },
            { "ACCESSCODES", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Corrupted Codes</style>
The codes still open things. Some of the things they open were never meant to be closed." },
            { "WICKEDRING", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Ring</style>
A ring around nothing. Each precise blow pours through it and returns as time." },
            { "OLDBOX", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Hollow Box</style>
Something lives in the box. It doesn't like visitors. It likes the holder's enemies even less." },
            { "EMBRYO", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Stillborn Embryo</style>
It does not beat. It has never beaten. And yet equipment near it fires as though something inside were urging it on." },
            { "ATGMK2", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Plasma Barrage</style>
The missiles leave no trail. They don't need to. They know where they're going." },
            { "PLASMACHAIN", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Severing Chain</style>
It doesn't burn what crosses it. It cuts it, cleanly, through the middle." },
            { "HEAVENCRACKER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Abyss Cracker</style>
It does not crack the sky. It cracks whatever is beneath the floor." },
            { "MITOSIS", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Arrested Mitosis</style>
The cells stopped dividing. They didn't stop growing." },
            { "REPULSION", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Absorption Armor</style>
The old armor pushed blows away. This one swallows them, and grows thicker." },
            { "LASERTURBINE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Void Turbine</style>
It spins in reverse. When it discharges, it pulls the light out of the room." },
            { "LOPPER", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Rusted Cleaver</style>
The rust is not iron. It spreads from the wound and keeps cutting." },
            { "PHOTONJETPACK", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Graviton Pack</style>
It doesn't push its wearer upward. It pulls the world downward, just a little, just around them." },
            { "TELESCOPE", @"<style=cMono>// Containment Log — Obsidian Scope</style>
Through the black glass, every living thing has a seam. Sometimes the seam opens." },
